NOTICE ON VOICE MODELS

This software ships no third-party voice checkpoints. Voice models you supply
carry the license of whoever trained them, and the recordings they were trained
on may carry additional rights.

Cloning or impersonating a real person's voice without their consent may be
unlawful (fraud, defamation, right of publicity, biometric data protection).
You are responsible for how you use this software.
